{c: Verse 1}
[A] Dooron Dooron Main Vekhan Tenu [F#m] Soniyo,        [A] Kaha Tu Kaha [D] Main
[A] Dooran Dooran Main Vekhan Tenu [F#m] Soniyo,        [A] Kaha Tu Kaha [D] Main
[D] Ki Main Kara Ke Main,        [F#m] Aawan Nazar Tenu
[D] Laayak Tere Kive Hova,        [F#m] Tu Dass Mainu
[Bm] Kol Tere Mainu [F#m] Aan De Soniyo,        [D] Kara Main Kitne [A] Jatan
